  "label": "September 11, 2001 Terrorist Attacks",
  "description": "A series of coordinated terrorist attacks carried out by the extremist group al-Qaeda against the United States, which included the hijacking of four commercial airplanes. Two of the planes were flown into the Twin Towers of the World Trade Center in New York City, causing their collapse and resulting in nearly 3,000 deaths. This event is one of the most significant and tragic moments in modern history and is widely recognized globally.",
